hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"170","Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Kabir Al-Souri in Fustat told us, Shurayh bin Al-Numan told us, Falayh told us. Ahmad ibn Al-Azhar narrated to us, and I wrote it down from its origin, Yunus ibn Muhammad narrated to us, Falayh, who is Ibn Sulayman, narrated to us, on the authority of Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm, on the authority of Abbad bin Tamim, on the authority of Abdullah bin Zaid, that the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, “performed ablution \twice twice\"""""""
